        },
        {
          "text": "Mbaabo bana ba-Levi anzubo zyabo, bapati banzubo mbubakalembwa, mweelwe wamazina niwakabalwa, bantu boonse ibakali kubeleka milimo yaŋanda ya-Jehova, ibakajisi myaka iili makumi obile na kusotoka, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
