              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nkaambo Davida wakaamba kuti, Jehova Leza wa-Israyeli wapa bantu bakwe luumuno, alimwi ulikede mu-Jerusalemu lyoonse. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
