              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "(nkaambo mbaabo ba-Levi ibakabalwa kumulazyo musyaalizi wa-Davida, boonse ibakajisi myaka iili makumi obile nanka kusotoka), ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
